    "module": {
      "purpose": "Bundler-specific client config for React Flight in the Parcel ecosystem. Implements module resolution, chunk loading, and reference handling by delegating to parcelRequire while satisfying the shared ReactFlightClientConfig contract.",
      "summary": "This file is the Parcel-bundler implementation of the React Flight client-side configuration. It provides functions for resolving server and client references, preloading modules via an import map, requiring module exports, and computing debug info. It relies on parcelRequire for dynamic loading and module resolution, and imports metadata indices from ReactFlightImportMetadata. It bridges React Flight's universal RSC client contract with Parcel's bundler capabilities.",
